# The video under "The different views" on the navigation guide: open an agent onto the stage,
# then cycle the keyboard through the list, the agent and the details with C-a and back with
# C-q. navigation-views.before fills the panel with three workflows and six haiku agents.
Source recordings/panel.tape
Wait+Screen@60s /help-tags/
Type "j"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+A
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+A
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+Q
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+Q
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+Q
Sleep 1s
